    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All pieces have a separate cooldown for moving and movement options, pieces can also be combined to make new pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413540/extras/c3c2ae1f2e5a20e00e0f247d13844a78.poster.avif?t=1755003178\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413540/extras/c3c2ae1f2e5a20e00e0f247d13844a78.webm?t=1755003178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413540/extras/c3c2ae1f2e5a20e00e0f247d13844a78.mp4?t=1755003178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to spice up the chess theme a bit more the map is made out of hexagons where each has its own type (biome)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413540/extras/460dbb6b8871f6f86c968547d4b95f4d.poster.avif?t=1755003178\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413540/extras/460dbb6b8871f6f86c968547d4b95f4d.webm?t=1755003178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413540/extras/460dbb6b8871f6f86c968547d4b95f4d.mp4?t=1755003178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buildings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build buildings that buff, produce or alter pieces and their movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413540/extras/0a8bec4a1613e867a748e2a8516fc9b1.poster.avif?t=1755003178\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413540/extras/0a8bec4a1613e867a748e2a8516fc9b1.webm?t=1755003178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413540/extras/0a8bec4a1613e867a748e2a8516fc9b1.mp4?t=1755003178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fog of war, classic, archon, all out</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Preserving the Chess theme</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike other RTS games RTS Chess does not have resources and resource management as to preserve the chess theme everything is visible on the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The primary resources of the game are pawns which are used for building and upgrading buildings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All pieces have a separate cooldown for moving and movement options, pieces can also be combined to make new pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413540/extras/c3c2ae1f2e5a20e00e0f247d13844a78.poster.avif?t=1755003178\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413540/extras/c3c2ae1f2e5a20e00e0f247d13844a78.webm?t=1755003178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413540/extras/c3c2ae1f2e5a20e00e0f247d13844a78.mp4?t=1755003178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to spice up the chess theme a bit more the map is made out of hexagons where each has its own type (biome)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413540/extras/460dbb6b8871f6f86c968547d4b95f4d.poster.avif?t=1755003178\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413540/extras/460dbb6b8871f6f86c968547d4b95f4d.webm?t=1755003178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413540/extras/460dbb6b8871f6f86c968547d4b95f4d.mp4?t=1755003178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buildings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build buildings that buff, produce or alter pieces and their movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413540/extras/0a8bec4a1613e867a748e2a8516fc9b1.poster.avif?t=1755003178\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413540/extras/0a8bec4a1613e867a748e2a8516fc9b1.webm?t=1755003178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413540/extras/0a8bec4a1613e867a748e2a8516fc9b1.mp4?t=1755003178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fog of war, classic, archon, all out</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Preserving the Chess theme</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike other RTS games RTS Chess does not have resources and resource management as to preserve the chess theme everything is visible on the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The primary resources of the game are pawns which are used for building and upgrading buildings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "In this unique RTS twist on the classic game, every move on the chessboard opens up new possibilities for building, upgrading and dominating your opponents. Play chess on a new hexagon board that allows you to reach new places and make the tactical part of chess even more tactical.",
